<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; }
    .logo { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .logo h1 { color: #1a1a2e; font-size: 28px; margin: 0; }
    .logo span { color: #e94560; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #e94560; color: white; padding: 12px 32px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; margin: 16px 0; }
    p { color: #444; line-height: 1.6; }
    .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #888; font-size: 12px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="logo"><h1>kala<span>CUBE</span></h1></div>
    <h2>Verify your email, {{firstName}}</h2>
    <p>Click the button below to verify your email address:</p>
    <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="{{verificationUrl}}" class="btn">Verify Email</a></p>
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #888;">If you didn't create a kalaCUBE account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>kalaCUBE — Where Art Meets Community</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
